# VarAlign local store: intentionally not mentioned here. .varmem/.gitignore
# fully self-manages what's tracked (only .gitignore/reviews.json/config.json)
# vs ignored (vars/, events.jsonl, meta.json) — a root-level entry here would
# either re-break that (a bare `.varmem/` excludes the whole dir, which
# prevents the nested .gitignore's negation rules from ever taking effect)
# or be redundant with it (a `.varmem/*` entry decides nothing the nested
# file doesn't already decide on its own).
